window.products.push({"id":941110,"name":"Pillowflex Bolster Pillow - 9\" x 60\" - Plush Polyester-Filled Insert for Decorative Shams - Comes in a Poly-Cotton Shell - Odorless, Lint, and Dust-Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lxbtQqj2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Finally! Quality bolster sham pillow inserts worthy of being stuffed into your beautiful pillow sham covers. Impress your Friends and Family, this Pillowflex Bolster Pillow is made to look great in your shams! - made from a plush polyester fiber that is ultra-comfortable. - odorless, lint and dust-free, free of flame retardant chemicals - full and firm enough for your sham to keep its shape while also being soft to the touch - contains slick polyester fiber to keep the pillow's filler smooth instead of dry fibers that will quickly lump up and need replacing - it comes in an American-made pillow shell from a high thread count poly cotton blended fabric that is durable and machine washable, machine dry (cover is not removable) - made in the USA from American Fibers and Shell Use as an insert in decorative shams, Couch shams, Bedroom shams, Crafting, sleeping, or anywhere you need a pillow! Not for yoga use. Intended for indoor uses but may also be used outdoors. Sizing: Start by measuring your shams, pull tight along the outer seam, and measure corner to corner. This should be done for all shams, even if the size is marked. Please order the same size bolster as your sham.*** Check the pink sizing image for help knowing your sham's diameter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lxbtQqj2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pillowflex","source_asin":"B00G2G06QO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G2G06QO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G2G06QO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
