window.products.push({"id":941231,"name":"oobest Automatic Foaming Soap Dispensers Touchless Hand Sanitizer Dispensers with Wall-Mounted - 2 Modes Adjustable for Kitchen Bathroom Countertop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513zSxIecYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features and Function Using advanced infrared human sensing technology Automatic human hand sensor to avoid secondary cross-infection Humanization design concept, you can put it on countertop or wall Save money and soap, dispense foam instead of soap Through a stand-alone button to easily adjust the amount of a single liquid Specifications Material: ABS plastic Capacity of dispenser:300ml Input Power: 4 AAA Batteries(not included) Size: 125mm x 75mm x 188mm(L x W x H) Weight: 500g How to use the automatic foam soap dispenser 1. Lift the host 2. Unscrew the bottle and take it out 3. Fill in foam soap 300ml(or 100ml normal soap plus 100-200ml water) and put the bottle back to host 4. Prize up(NOT SLIDE) battery box cover and install 4 AAA batteries 5. Long press on-off button for 2 seconds to turn on device, put your hand close to area of sensor, device will work (suggest to test it with water first) 6. Short press on-off button to switch 2 levels Battery Removal and Installation Instructions Prize up(NOT SLIDE) the cover at back of device. Insert 4 x AAA batteries into the compartment and make sure the polarity is correct. DO NOT MIX OLD BATTERIES WITH NEW BATTERIES Put the cover back into position Please remove batteries if device is not in use to avoid damage Package Contents 1 x oobest Soap Dispenser 1 x User Manual Note 1.Battery and Foam Soap are not included in this package 2.Please add normal soap with 100-200ml water","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513zSxIecYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"oobest","source_asin":"B01N49OZK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N49OZK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N49OZK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":941232,"name":"2nd Anniversary Christmas Tree Ornament - Reads Our 2nd Christmas Together","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MU9XG0btL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A stunning addition to your Christmas tree this festive season is this solid metal and hand sculpted 2nd anniversary Christmas tree hanging decoration. If you have celebrated your 2nd wedding anniversary this year then this decoration is just a perfect way to hang this memory from your tree. We see lots of babies 1st Christmas hanging ornaments but now you can have a 2nd anniversary hanging Christmas tree ornament.  We have two version, one reads 'Our 2nd Christmas as Husband & Wife' perfect if you are celebrating your 2nd wedding anniversary.  A second which reads, 'Our 2nd Christmas together' Perfect if you are together but not yet married. A perfect Christmas tree ornament for anyone.  Features a rustic hanging heart which hangs from a red ribbon with a cast holly in the left hand corner, the text is hand stamped so no piece is the same.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MU9XG0btL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pirantin","source_asin":"B0769STW4Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0769STW4Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0769STW4Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
