window.products.push({"id":941251,"name":"Pink Flamingo in Water Wood Christmas Tree Holiday Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IsNf5e3mL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"HOLIDAY CHEER TO SHARE: Put your own spin on holiday traditions with our heirloom-quality ornaments. Available in a variety of themes and fandoms, these colorful ornaments have a personal, hand-made feel and make versatile holiday decorations. GENUINE MAPLE VENEER: Crafted from natural-finish wood, our ornaments are printed on one side with the festive design shown. Unlike glass bulbs, our ornaments are shatterproof, making them perfect for families with kids or pets. Hanging cord included. Dimensions 3.0\" (7.6 cm) x 3.6\" (9.1 cm). FUN FOR KIDS, TEENS AND ADULTS: Suitable for all ages, these durable ornaments are great for accenting Christmas decorations, personalizing for loved ones, gift swaps, or just admiring. Perfect as holiday party favors, goodie bag fillers, team gifts, or anyone on your Nice list. All creative internal designs apply. In other words unlicensed. A Graphics and More product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IsNf5e3mL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRAPHICS & MORE","source_asin":"B076F99KFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076F99KFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076F99KFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":941252,"name":"Home Office Chair Ergonomic Executive PU Leather Desk Chair Adjustable Stool Rolling Swivel Rocking Mid Back Computer Task Chair for Women Adults (Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618woYxFDkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The main feature of this office chair newly launched by Tffnew is that it is compact and convenient, without armrests, and can be easily placed in a small space without taking up space at all. The cover of PU leather and the filling of thick sponge can provide extra comfort during long working hours. An easy opportunity to eliminate back pain caused by prolonged sitting. The contoured seat eliminates pressure points and increases comfort. This will help improve your posture. Feature: 💡The surface of the office chair is covered with high-quality PU leather, which is dirt-resistant and easy to clean. 💡The seat cushion of the chair is filled with high-density sponge, so you will not feel tired after sitting for a long time. 💡The height of the office chair can be adjusted according to different needs (16 \"-19\") 💡Sturdy rotatable universal wheels and chairs can rotate 360 ​​degrees to achieve flexible office work. 💡Suitable for many occasions: office, meeting room, bedroom, etc. (Without armrests, it can adapt to small spaces) 💡Equipped with commercial standard air lift office chairs, you will feel comfortable, convenient and enjoy. 💡Easy to assemble. It is estimated that the assembly time of the desk and chair is about 10-15 minutes. Specification: 🏷️Color: black, white 🏷️Material: PU leather, high density sponge, metal bottom 🏷️Seat size: 18\" (W) x 16\" (D) 🏷️Weight: 250 pounds ★All accessories have passed BIFMA test. About Tffnew: Delivery: After purchase, we will choose a warehouse closest to you for fast delivery. The delivery time is usually 3-6 days. After-sales service: Tffnew stores provide long-term after-sales service. If you have any questions about the product, please contact us in time and we will reply you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618woYxFDkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tffnew","source_asin":"B08P77C6YB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P77C6YB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P77C6YB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":941253,"name":"Department 56 Elf the Movie Village Buddy Accessory Figurine, 2.8\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Db2BEDutL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Christmas Evening, a group of friends set off to enjoy a dinner of celebration at a small country Inn nestled in a quiet River town. As they rounded a bend in the road, they saw the small, old-fashioned village decorated for the holidays. The lights, like fairies, glowed and sparkled amid the freshly fallen snow. All Evening, the conversation was full of Christmas memories and the visions the tiny town had evoked. Amidst the jovial banter and magical memories, the idea for a lighted Christmas village was born. That spark of an idea became a reality when, in 1976, Department 56 introduced a series of six hand-painted, ceramic buildings. The rest is history. Department 56 knows the importance of celebrating the holidays with family and friends. Savor your time together and make it extra special with Department 56.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Db2BEDutL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B01A9A15H2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A9A15H2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A9A15H2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
