window.products.push({"id":941298,"name":"Wahdawn Aromatic Cedar Blocks for Clothes Storage, Big Cedar Wood Cubes Closets Natural Clothes Protector Dresser Drawers Air Freshener, House Organiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LfvwhAYYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material and Effective: Fragrance Cedar hearts blocks 100% made from original organic American Eastern Red Cedarwood for closets and drawers clothing protection and home air freshener. What is Eastern Red Cedar : Lumber taken from the eastern red cedar is a red, fragrant and strong wood. It frequently is used to make furniture, especially chests, dressers, lockers and similar pieces. The scent of eastern red cedar strong enough prevent from harmful elements that can damage the fabrics and render clothes unusable, making the cedar wood ideal for clothing storage. But the more popular western red cedar can't reach the effective, So Eastern Red Cedar is Your Better Choice Cedar Value Packing and Usage Instruction.15 Pack Big square shape cedar blocks: Solid polished cedar wood in the shape of hearts, idear for closets storage, drawers, amazon locker, dressers,cupboard, chests, underbed storage bins, shoes or cars. Long Lasting and Renewable Scent : Cedar fragrance lasting 4-6 months, refresh the cedar approx 6 months - 1 year (lasting time depend on the humidity and exposure to open air), just sand cedar surface lightly with sand paper or use cedar spray or essential oils,best effective used in enclosed space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LfvwhAYYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wahdawn","source_asin":"B089NZGFXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089NZGFXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089NZGFXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
