window.products.push({"id":941341,"name":"Personalized Ravenscroft Lead-free Crystal Handled Captain's Wine Decanter & 4 Stemmed Vintner's Choice Bordeaux/Merlot/Cabernet Red Wine Glasses Engr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CVZPM+odL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Whether you’re looking for a monogrammed decanter that lets a wine breathe or just want one that will grace your table, you don’t have to settle for assembly-line style or quality. Ravenscroft's lead-free decanters are produced from the purest crystal, ensuring that your vintage is free from impurities. This Ravenscroft Crystal Handled Captain's Decanter wine decanter personalized with engraving is a beautiful piece on your own table or to give as a truly thoughtful gift. This unique and impressive design makes a fabulous gift for any true wine connoisseur too. The wide base of the Ravenscroft Handled Captain's Decanter wine decanter is ideal for enhancing the aeration process before serving your precious reserves. Its cutting edge design creates maximum breathing room for your wine that allows the wine to aerate and release flavors and aromas which enhance the attributes of your wine. Decanting wines (particularly old wines) just before serving ensures clarity and true color while preventing any sediment from interfering with the wine-drinking experience. Decanting young wines several hours before they are served gives the wine a chance to bloom and attain a stage of development that normally requires years of aging. This lead-free crystal decanter features a nearly flawless finish, meticulously hand-crafted by European artisans for unsurpassed quality. Ideal for nearly any type of wine, this lovely decanter is also a handsome accessory for your bar. This Ravenscroft Handled Captain's Decanter wine decanter has an elegant shape, perfectly balanced base and fluted mouth. Its handle holds comfortably in your hand for added confidence in pouring.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CVZPM+odL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crystalize","source_asin":"B075FBKBHN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075FBKBHN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075FBKBHN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
