window.products.push({"id":941462,"name":"Silicone Collapsible Food Storage Containers,Set of 4 Round Folding Silicone Lunch Box,Microwave and Freezer Safe (Multi)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NQYa2yRIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"*Size: Set of 4 assorted collapsible silicone containers - Includes one of each size for the best value: Small (4.7''), Medium (5.5''), Large (6.3''), and Extra Large (7.1''). Perfect silicone food containers set for kids lunch boxes, leftovers, take out or as meal prep container. Each container is great to keep dry or wet foods like cereal, fruits, vegetables, baby foods stay fresh. *Collapsible: Rectangular food containers for meal prepping collapse to 1/3 their original size with nesting design for maximum organization. Fits into almost all kitchen and pantry compartments or any cabinet or drawer. Those are the perfect choice for small apartments, dorms, RVs, camping and more! *Safe: Each container is collapsible to 1/3 its original size for easy compact storage and organization. Stop searching through your cluttered container cabinet looking for the right lid for your containers. Our lids snap shut making them stackable and saving you 60% more space! Thin Bins are the perfect choice for small apartments, dorms, RVs, camping and more! *Design: Our snap on lids create an airtight vacuum seal that will keep your food secured and fresher longer.Our temperature resistant silicone makes them microwave and freezer safe. Great for storing leftovers in the fridge and microwavable for when you’re ready to enjoy your meal. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED – We are so confident in the quality of our Thin Bins that we will stand behind our product with a replacement or your money back. Each set comes with a manufacturer’s warranty, so you can buy with confidence!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NQYa2yRIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cvwjz","source_asin":"B09YKBLMRK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YKBLMRK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YKBLMRK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":941463,"name":"Espresso Machine Grease, 2 x 10g Silicone Grease Maintenance Kit for Care and Maintenance of All Coffee Machines, Food Grade Grease for All Expresso M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wq0DCaplL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food Grade Silicone Grease:Espresso Machine Grease is specially formulated with the highest quality silicone fluids and additives to meet the unique demands placed on food processing equipment. This silicone grease lubricant has passed NFC H1 SG Certificate Certification. The Role of Espresso Machine Grease: The gear in the coffee grinder is a crucial transmission component. The gear drives the work of the blade and increases the rotational torque of the blade, which can better grind the coffee beans. Therefore, it is essential to lubricate the coffee grinder. Choosing a suitable silicone grease can effectively lubricate and protect the gears, reduce noise, reduce gear wear, prolong the service life of the grinder, and ensure grinding. Easy to Use: The brewer of most fully automatic espresso machines can be dismantled and cleaned. Open the shell on the side of the coffee machine (the service door, usually with a special handle), you can see the brewer, and dry it after cleaning. Dry the brewer, and then apply the food grade lubricant grease evenly to the rails on both sides of the brewer or the drive shaft. Pay attention to applying evenly, you can use the small brush we distribute for food safe grease. Suitable for More Small Appliances: Not only suitable for all expresso machines, but also suitable for cooking machines, food supplement machines, soy milk machines, and other models. Silicone grease food grade is the best choice for maintenance and care of small household appliances. Thoughtful after-sales service: Customer satisfaction is always the first. If you are not satisfied with food safe lubricant gel you received, please feel free to contact us, we will be happy to provide you with a replacement or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wq0DCaplL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nayrmaer","source_asin":"B0BXKW8V4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXKW8V4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXKW8V4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
