window.products.push({"id":941514,"name":"Bakehope French Rolling Pin for Baking Pasta Pizza Bread, Natural Beech Wood Dough Roller(15.75 Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MyOqFxNmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Wood French Rolling Pin - crafted from solid beech wood for durable rolling Ergonomic Design & Appropriate Lightweight Size - the rolling pin ends go smaller like a tampered handle,measured at 15.75 in X 0.87 in Healthy Dough Roller - finely polished with no bits of wood, smooth and straight surface with no paint or wax Easy to Clean - hand wash by cleanning it with wet cloth,store it in a cool place Excellent Service - if you are not satisfied with this baking roller, feel free to request a refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MyOqFxNmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bakehope","source_asin":"B09L5191FX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L5191FX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L5191FX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":941515,"name":"Sofa Stud Mugworthy Couch Mug & Cup Holder - Spill Proof, Convenient, Versatile Drink Coaster Molded from BPA Free, Impact Resistant, Durable Plastic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZEOwqD9eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No more having to constantly reach for your favorite drink on the coffee table or balancing it on your lap or couch cushions! Sofa Stud is the revolutionary couch cup holder that resists bumps & bounces and gives everyone on the sofa a place to safely put their drink conveniently within reach, without risk of spilling or taking up valuable sofa real estate. That’s right, even the middle seats now have a secure drink holder! Sofa Stud is more convenient, portable, and versatile than a couch caddy, arm table, or side table. And it’s so easy to use due to its ingeniously simple patent-pending design. Sofa Stud is built with a slim paddle that fits firmly between couch cushions to resist bumps and bouncing, and a broad-based cup holder that rests securely on top to catch drips, runs, and condensation. All you need to do is take your Sofa Stud and slide the paddle in between your sofa cushions until the base of the cup holder rests firmly on the surface, place your favorite hot or cold drink in the holder and you’re good to go! Sofa Stud is molded from BPA-free, impact-resistant polymer resins that are made to withstand life, while providing you the most bang for your buck. It’s a great way to protect upholstery from accidents, while keeping your drink conveniently within reach. The Sofa Stud fits a variety of cups, cans, bottles, and other items, such as remote controls, snacks and smartphones. If it’s a 12-ounce drink, it probably fits, whether it’s normal, tall, skinny, or in-between. Keep everything you need easily within arm’s reach, while preventing knocks, spills and stains, as you sink into your couch and enjoy a movie, TV show, live sports or a great book. Convenience, cleanliness, portability, simplicity, and great value are just a few of the many reasons why Sofa Stud is a great cup holder for Super Bowl parties, birthdays, baby showers, family gatherings, holidays or just getting cozy on the sofa. So go ahead and hand out one with every drink!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZEOwqD9eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sofa Stud","source_asin":"B09YWX3BZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YWX3BZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YWX3BZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
