window.products.push({"id":941592,"name":"Instant Pot Accessories Set (7 Pieces)-Fits 5,6,8 Quart Pressure Cooker Accessories Steamer Basket Springform Pan Egg Rack Egg Bites Mold Plate Grippe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LkdEvzRWL._AC_.jpg","description":"Superlife Coco instant pot 8 quart set fits in the heathier lifestyle nowadays. Steam Basket The steaming is a healthier cooking style. Cook food with steamer rack can retain more vitamins, nutrients, and texture than boiling, microwaving and frying method. Especially steaming fruit and vegetables for making baby food. Springform Pan For cakes that cannot withstand being flipped upside-down for pan removal, a spring form pan is a necessity. （ Note: Use a mild detergent when cleaning and clean with a cleaning cloth. Remember to wipe off the water when cleaning is finished. ） Egg Steam Stand The perfect tool for cooking eggs, the hole will keep eggs stable, and it can cook max 14 eggs at the same time; Also can use as the steaming rack, cooling rack, pot stand rack etc. Silicon Egg Bites Mold It can help you store fresh, home-made baby food . Hard plastic lid snaps on with ease and allows for convenient stacking of freezer trays. Importantly, Food slides out and clean up is a breeze. Package include : 1 * stainless steel steamer basket (Size: 8.3 in) 1 * non-stick springform pan (Size: 8 in) 1 * steamer egg rack (Size: 6.3 in , single hole diameter: 1.6 in) 1 * silicon egg bites mold (Size: 6.3 in, single hole diameter: 1.6 in) 1 * cleaning cloth (Size: 12 in * 12 in) 1 * plate gripper 2 * silicon milts Free Recipes eBook Tips: 1. Don't use steel wool or any heavy - duty cleanser. If hand washing, a mild cleaner, and warm water is recommended. 2. No matter cleaning by dishwasher or hand, there is a point in drying it promptly to prevent stubborn spot trace, streak, discoloration, or corrosion. 3. Suitable for 5, 6 ,8QT, please purchase after measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LkdEvzRWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Superlife Coco","source_asin":"B07GS87LKG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GS87LKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GS87LKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
