window.products.push({"id":941617,"name":"Electric Juicer,Small Portable Juice Cup Household Electric Juicer Mini Automatic Juice Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51COj0Au3HL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Condition:100% Brand New Color: White, Pink(Optional) Size: Approx.84*84*193Mm/3.3*3.3*7.6In Weight: Approx. 400G/14.1Oz Product Capacity: 300Ml Product Power: 60W Charging Voltage: 5V ~ Working Voltage: 7.4V~ Lithium Battery Capacity: 700Mah*2 Charging Time: 2 Hours Charging Interface: UsbtypeC Interface Single Working Time: 30 Seconds Full Power Work: About 15 Times Instructions For Use: 1. Fruit Cut Into The Filter 2. Filter Into The Cup And Pour Water 3. Cover The Lid The Green Light Flashes To Indicate That It Is Tightened Double Click To Start 4. Inverted Cup Gently Shake 5. Open The Lid Take Out The Filter Package List: 1* Juicer 1* Charging Cable Note: Because There Was A Manual Measuring ,The Size May Has 1-2Cm/Inch Difference . The Color May Be Slight Different Due To The Condition Or Light Or Different Monitor .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51COj0Au3HL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zouminy","source_asin":"B087NJY96S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087NJY96S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087NJY96S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
