window.products.push({"id":941645,"name":"TJ Global Handmade Standing Santa Claus Plush Doll Figurine Decoration, Holiday Present, Home Ornaments, Christmas Decoration (22 Inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kQbgoioTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Celebrate Christmas and the holiday season with this adorable and whimsical standing Santa. He will surely brighten up any home and complement your Christmas decorations perfectly while adding a fun and festive touch! It is surely a unique piece to add to your collection; Its lovely appearance makes it an essential decoration for your fireplace, Christmas tree, shelf or table. A must for any Santa Claus collector or lover!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kQbgoioTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TJ Global","source_asin":"B07WV5RZ3D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WV5RZ3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WV5RZ3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":941646,"name":"Adeco 6 Opening Decorative Iorn Metal Wall Hanging Collage Picture Photo Frame, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xDuSEatWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique and modernly minimalist, this pretty, 14x25-inch collage picture frame is the perfect choice for any wall in the home in need of a personal touch. Six 4x6-inch vertical images can be displayed within the slim, antiqued-steel frames, affixed among a field of undulating, arching steel strands. The solid steel frame is easy to hang, requiring a single nail rather than the numerous holes in the wall generally needed to display multiple frames. Fill the welcoming spaces with special people or fond memories, and enjoy the sense of warmth and family you get each time you look at this lovely piece of decor. The frame also makes an excellent wedding, anniversary, or house warming gift for someone special.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xDuSEatWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adeco","source_asin":"B01M351N3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M351N3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M351N3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":941647,"name":"Bosmarlin Large Ceramic Coffee Mug, Pink Big Tea Cup for Office and Home, 21 Oz, Dishwasher and Microwave Safe (Pink, 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xLPN5e0vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This mug has a large capacity(21 oz), which will definitely meet your needs for office and home. STURDY & DURABLE: Designed with strong ceramic construction, made of lead-free, cadmium-free, high quality ceramic. Suitable for hot and cold drinks. Dishwasher and microwave safe. EASY TO HOLD: Big handle can keep it from rotating when you try to hold the mug, which helps you enjoy your tea/coffee comfortably. UNIQUE GLAZE: So simple but classic design. Every mug is unique because of the special reactive glaze technique. A choice of four stylish colors makes a great gift for the Holidays, birthdays and special occasions. If you have any problem with our mug after received, just contact us! We promise that we will make every effort to solve it. We care deeply for our customers and make you our top priority! Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xLPN5e0vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bosmarlin","source_asin":"B09PTK9GM4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PTK9GM4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PTK9GM4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":941648,"name":"Butterfly Craze Peach Artificial Peony Silk Flowers - Stunning Home Floral Decoration or Wedding Bouquet - Lifelike Petals and Elegant Design to Add B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91s7ZQ+86wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A SPLASH OF SPRING COLOR: These faux peonies are made of top-notch materials that give them a natural and realistic look, perfect for bringing a touch of freshness and charm to any setting. Whether you're using them for a wedding bouquet, sprucing up your home or office, or gifting them to someone special, these peonies are the perfect choice. Their beauty and durability make them a timeless addition to any decor, ensuring they will be admired for years to come. BRIDAL BOUQUETS: These lifelike flowers come in a variety of vibrant shades and are perfect for both indoor and outdoor events. Use them to create a stunning bridal bouquet, or place them in vases as eye-catching table centerpieces. For a fun twist, pair them with delicate baby's breath to make a charming flower girl's crown. With Butterfly Craze's artificial peonies, you can enjoy the natural beauty of these flowers without the worry of wilting or fading. AN IDEAL HOME OR OFFICE DECORATION: These lifelike flowers are perfect for adding a touch of elegance and color to any space. Place them in a flowerpot to dress up your conference room or use them to add charm to your mantelpiece, patio or any room in the house. Unlike real flowers, these silk peonies never wilt and never need water, making them a low-maintenance way to brighten up your space. With their natural look and feel, you'll forget they're not the real thing. BRIGHTEN UP SOMEONE'S DAY: These beautiful flowers are an excellent way to show someone you care. Pair them with wisteria, greenery, or exotic plants to create a stunning hanging basket for a friend's front porch or send them as a gift to cheer up a loved one who's ill or in the hospital. Unlike real flowers, these silk blossoms will never wilt or die, serving as a lasting reminder of your love and support. With their natural look, these peonies are sure to bring a smile to anyone's face. ELEVATE YOUR EVENT'S DECOR: The set includes 5 lifelike stems, each boasting a single vibrant blossom measuring 3.5\" in diameter. Standing at 14\" from the top of the bloom to the end of the stem, they offer a striking visual impact. Ensure optimal fluffiness by gently shaping them a day or two before the occasion, as shipping and storage can cause slight creases. Ideal for weddings, parties, or as a stunning centerpiece, these high-quality peonies are sure to impress.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91s7ZQ+86wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Butterfly Craze","source_asin":"B079TFSXRM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079TFSXRM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079TFSXRM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
