window.products.push({"id":941707,"name":"HENCKELS Silvercap Razor-Sharp 2-Piece Knife Set, Santoku Knife 5 Inch, Santoku Knife 7 Inch , German Engineered Informed by 100+ Years of Mastery","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51h0Q+LecJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Henckels International Silver cap 2-pc Asian Knife Set is perfect for performing detailed kitchen tasks with ease. Thanks to their handy micro-serrated edge, the low-maintenance blades never need to be sharpened. Effortlessly mince garlic with the 5\" Hollow Edge Santoku Knife and confidently dice onion or slice fish with the Asian all-rounder 7\" Hollow Edge Santoku Knife. Both knife blades have small indentations, aka grantons, which prevent food from sticking while cutting. The knives offer single-piece, precision-stamped construction for long-lasting durability. Fabricated from superior stainless steel, the lightweight knives are easy to maneuver. The traditional, triple-riveted handle provides balance and comfort as you chop. With their stylish, stainless steel endcaps, you'll want to show off your Silver cap. Henckels International makes essential kitchen tools every home chef needs. From steak knives to spatulas, every product offers high quality at an exceptional value. Created in 1895 by Zwilling J.A. Henckels, this value-driven brand guarantees the same durability, design and ease of use for which the global company is known. Equip your kitchen with expertise with Henckels International.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51h0Q+LecJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENCKELS","source_asin":"B0C5Z1W1M4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5Z1W1M4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5Z1W1M4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":941708,"name":"Puzzle Box - Japanese 2 Sun Cube: Yosegi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Z0kqSfkLL._AC_.jpg","description":"Yosegi, or yosegi-zaiku, is a type of traditional Japanese mosaic woodwork which originated in Japans culturally rich Edo Period. Yosegi veneers are commonly found on the outside of Japanese secret boxes (Himitsu-Bako) or puzzle boxes, but may also be used to decorate many other items such as trays, chests, kendama, coasters, photo frames and jewelry boxes. Zougan-Zaiku Marquetry Wooden Mosaic is made by setting patterns of landscapes and characters created by natural wood colors, which are cut out from wood materials, in a main board.This process is very intricate and timely. Yosegi and Zougan Japanese puzzle box is high class puzzle box and limited.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Z0kqSfkLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bene Gifts","source_asin":"B001NV1EDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001NV1EDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001NV1EDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
