window.products.push({"id":941801,"name":"Parve Green Pizza Wheel – Ultra Sharp Rolling Knife, Stainless steel Cutter – Long Silicone Handle, Comfortable Grip – Color Coded Home and Kitchen Ac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S7mdkIxYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your kitchen kosher while using the highest quality kitchen accessories with The Kosher Cook! Slice through crusts and doughy food items with our premium pizza cutter that rolls through all types of foods quickly and effectively. Using quality materials, you’re sure to get the perfect slice of pizza or piece of dough for baking with just one smooth motion. PRODUCT FEATURES Super Sharp Cutting Tool  Comfortable Handle Grip  Rolling Feature for Smooth and Seamless Cutting Through Dough, Pizza, Cookies, and Other Desserts Color Separated for Kosher Household: - Blue for Dairy (Milchik)- Red for Meat (Fleishik)- Green For Parve With just one utensil, you’ll be able to cut through doughy foods and other snacks with finesse. Our premium rolling cutter is the best tool to keep in your kitchen whenever you’re making a delicious homemade pizza, freshly baked cookies, and other doughy foods. A sharp blade gives you a seamless cutting experience so with just one motion, you’re getting the perfect slice every time. KEEPING IT KOSHER The Kosher Cook provides a wide array of tools to help separate milchig, fleishig and parev. Color coded products and tools along with labels and stickers allow you to see at a glance if the item is dairy, meat or pareve. Whether you are new to keeping kashrut or a seasoned veteran looking to make life easier, the Kosher Cook has the tools to keep the highest standards of kosher cooking. About The Kosher Cook Part of the Ner Mitzvah family, The Kosher Cook is another way we to help you keep Jewish traditions and laws. Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert maker of household products and the premier source for traditional and gift Judaica items.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S7mdkIxYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Kosher Cook","source_asin":"B07P6FMCFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P6FMCFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P6FMCFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
