window.products.push({"id":941955,"name":"2PACK Mini Bag Sealer, 2 in 1 Handheld Heat Seal and Cutter with Detachable Hook, Portable Food Saver Sealing Machine, Household Vacuum Resealer for P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PsEtmgtzS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍟【𝗘𝗔𝗦𝗬 𝘁𝗼 𝗨𝗦𝗘】- User Manual included, the chip bag sealer simply needs 2 AA batteries (not included) to work. Pull off the hook and warm up the bag sealer heat seal by pressing the Sealing End (\"+\" ) for 5 seconds, then put the bag’s opening edge in between, push the Sealing End and hold to slide along the edge SLOWLY and constantly. Avoid squeezing hard as it may melt the plastic. The other end \"-\" (Cutter) can be used as a bag opener by press and slide along the bag edge smoothly. 🍟【𝗖𝗢𝗠𝗣𝗔𝗖𝗧 & 𝗖𝗢𝗡𝗩𝗘𝗡𝗜𝗘𝗡𝗧】- Designed in lightweight style, this plastic sealer is smaller than a cellphone and super easy to carry. With the detachable handy hook, it is hangable anywhere you like and accessible within reach when needed. The little gadgets function well for either home use or outdoor activities, and helps keep your food fresh like new wherever you go - pantry, kitchen, living room, garage, tool room, work, travelling, hiking, camping, hunting, fishing… 🍟【𝗞𝗘𝗘𝗣 𝗙𝗢𝗢𝗗 𝗙𝗥𝗘𝗦𝗛】 - Use this heat sealer for plastic bags to seal all your food in airtight storage with and keep the food from going stale. Lock the freshness and flavor in your chips, snacks, cereal, meat, and leftovers. Reduce food waste, no more worry for container leakage or opening, and goodbye to mess and spoilage, with just a portable mini sealing machine for plastic bags, how great is that? 🍟【𝗪𝗢𝗥𝗞𝗦 𝗼𝗻 𝗠𝗔𝗡𝗬 𝗦𝗧𝗬𝗟𝗘 𝗕𝗔𝗚𝗦】- The plastic bag sealer mini is a must-have for whomever like chips and snacks. Applicable for bags made of various materials including PP, PE, PVC, and Coated aluminum foil bags. No more freezer zip loc packagings, chip clips or pins. Resealing and Reusing, keep a low-carbon and healthy lifestyle. 🍟【𝗪𝗔𝗥𝗠 𝗛𝗜𝗡𝗧】- To open the battery case please slightly squeezing the cover on the+sign toward the - sign. To install the batteries please see the direction instructed inside the battery case. When battery power is low, please replace them to keep a good sealing effect. Our mini sealer is fine to have the batteries left inside nonstop. For any further enquires about this sealer machine mini, please contact us right away, and give us a chance to improve your experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PsEtmgtzS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WinHill","source_asin":"B092225NCL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-941955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092225NCL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092225NCL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
